{"parse": {"title": "灵感·兽", "pageid": 364, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><h2><span id=\".E7.AE.80.E4.BB.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"简介\">简介</span></h2>\n<p>兽为循环四灵感之一。灵感为兽的神秘学家在设计上多与动物特征，本能，欲望等要素有关，故而兽系神秘学家中不乏奔放与狂野之徒。\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".E5.85.8B.E5.88.B6.E5.85.B3.E7.B3.BB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"克制关系\">克制关系</span></h2>\n<p>灵感·兽克制灵感·木，但会被灵感·岩所克制。\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".E7.81.B5.E6.84.9F.C2.B7.E5.85.BD_.E7.A5.9E.E7.A7.98.E5.AD.A6.E5.AE.B6.E5.88.97.E8.A1.A8\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"灵感·兽_神秘学家列表\">灵感·兽 神秘学家列表</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable mw-collapsible\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"6\">神秘学家列表\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"6\">灵感·兽<br /><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E7%81%B5%E6%84%9F%E5%9B%BE%E6%A0%87_%E5%85%BD_%E5%A4%A7.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"灵感图标 兽 大.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/%E7%81%B5%E6%84%9F%E5%9B%BE%E6%A0%87_%E5%85%BD_%E5%A4%A7.png/80px-%E7%81%B5%E6%84%9F%E5%9B%BE%E6%A0%87_%E5%85%BD_%E5%A4%A7.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/%E7%81%B5%E6%84%9F%E5%9B%BE%E6%A0%87_%E5%85%BD_%E5%A4%A7.png/120px-%E7%81%B5%E6%84%9F%E5%9B%BE%E6%A0%87_%E5%85%BD_%E5%A4%A7.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/%E7%81%B5%E6%84%9F%E5%9B%BE%E6%A0%87_%E5%85%BD_%E5%A4%A7.png/160px-%E7%81%B5%E6%84%9F%E5%9B%BE%E6%A0%87_%E5%85%BD_%E5%A4%A7.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>六星<br />✦✦✦✦✦✦\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:82px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%99%BE%E5%A4%AB%E9%95%BF\" title=\"百夫长\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/%E4%BA%BA%E7%89%A9_%E7%99%BE%E5%A4%AB%E9%95%BF%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F_%E5%8E%9F%E8%AE%BE.png/80px-%E4%BA%BA%E7%89%A9_%E7%99%